Title: "Introduction"
Id: "667a0429-84a8-40e8-8b43-09ff56ab956a"

Text: "Run `mlg` from the root of a MathLingua collection. The command discovers `.mlg` files, parses them, and applies the operation requested by the subcommand.

Most authoring workflows use two commands:

```text
mlg check
mlg view
```

Use `mlg check` when editing source and wanting fast diagnostics. Use `mlg view` when you want the rendered document in a browser."
Id: "9f14574f-ef2f-4399-b60c-41eba8976cad"
